### 1. QUERY Test (Read) - Get all entries
GET http://localhost:7001/entries


### 2. COMMAND Test (Create) - Add a new entry (As HOD Romania)
POST http://localhost:7001/entries
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Role: HOD
X-User-Country: Romania
X-User-Email: hod@tvr.ro

{
  "country": "Romania",
  "artist": "New Artist",
  "title": "Test song",
  "releaseYear": 2026
}


### 3. COMMAND Test (Delete) - Delete the entry with ID 2 (As ADMIN)
DELETE http://localhost:7001/entries/2
X-User-Role: ADMIN
X-User-Country: NULL
X-User-Email: admin@ebu.com


